# A pattern below a directory is the fiber of the directory over the pattern: the listing and the reads of what it
# yields are one place, the term `assets/regelingen/*/IO-*`.

route globbed.run
line entry > run call
line File(assets/regelingen/*/IO-*) > run own        # ASSETS.glob(..) lists it, m.read_text() reads what it yields
line run > Screen own

side entry left
side File(assets/regelingen/*/IO-*) left
side Screen right
